      ],
      "text": "FEATURE-MAP assigns ownership across crates: agent-runtime/agent for turn lifecycle and orchestration, model-provider for catalog/routing/retry, and tool-runtime for tool definitions, permissions, sandbox, dispatch, processes and MCP; the main-chain diagram lists thread-store/repository for persistence and projection."
    },
